This repository is an experimental Elixir library. It is not the upstream F3
project and it is not a production reader.

Upstream F3 is copyright 2025 Xinyu Zeng and Ruijun Meng and is licensed
under the MIT License. The research prototype lives at
https://github.com/future-file-format/F3. The format and the evaluation are
described in:

Xinyu Zeng, Ruijun Meng, Martin Prammer, Wes McKinney, Jignesh M. Patel,
Andrew Pavlo, and Huanchen Zhang. 2025. F3: The Open-Source Data File Format
for the Future. Proc. ACM Manag. Data 3, 4 (SIGMOD), Article 245.
https://doi.org/10.1145/3749163

Committed `test/fixtures/*.f3` files are generated by that upstream writer at
the commit recorded in `test/fixtures/manifest.json`. They are data, not a
copy of the upstream source tree. Upstream says the project is a research
prototype and should not be used in production. This library repeats that
warning.

The paper is published under a Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
License by its authors. This repository cites it. It does not redistribute
the paper.
